        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ecd19e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-28T03:55:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Interesting observation: When you get the Mint may not matter. I have unlocked all the variants, got Guise's special form, he unlocked as soon as I minted&nbsp;this week's weekly one shot. Maybe the condition is something along the lines of:</p>\n<p><strong>First, unlock all hero and villian variants. Then, you must win a game while Guise is in his special form, as well as obtain a Mint on any weekly one-shot&nbsp;(in either order).</strong></p>",
        "post_number": 74,
