      {
        "id": 227317,
        "name": "NyxFSSD",
        "username": "NyxFSSD",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f17d59/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-28T09:45:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The condition was already discovered and announced in this thread.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The community has discovered the official unlock condition for Completionist Guise!&nbsp;Since Guise is very particular about the purity of his collection, the only way to get him for now is the real way. It’s possible he may change his mind later, but he’s pretty stubborn. <em>I’m not stubborn! I’m principled. Also, I’m the best!</em></p>\n<p><strong>First, unlock all other variants via their story challenges. Then, in any order, earn a mint cover on a Weekly One-Shot, and activate the special form of Guise or Santa Guise.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
        "post_number": 75,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:29.109Z",
