        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-26T07:47:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Still can't unlock him.&nbsp; I'm confident that I have all variants (hero and villians), unlocked through gameplay rather than the quick button.&nbsp; I got a mint on this week's one-shot (using somebody's playthrough).&nbsp; I'm confident that I did Santa Guise's hidden form sometime after the update (but before the mint), so I was expecting the unlock.&nbsp; Nothing.&nbsp; So I tried another game to get the hidden form.&nbsp; Still no unlock.&nbsp;&nbsp; Hmmmm....</p>\n<p>I'm playing on an ipad.&nbsp; Incidentally, the Achievements button does nothing for me.&nbsp; And when I try to sync it through Options, it just freezes forever...</p>",
