        "created_at": "2019-06-27T03:47:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Sounds like you’re not signed in to Game Center. Check that in the Settings app.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thank you!  That did the trick.  Now I’m wondering how I’ve been playing this long without being signed in.  (Darn, I’m going to have to play more to reach all of those achievements…).</p>\n<p>It looks like it thinks I don’t have the Eternal Haka achievement.  That should be easy to do, but then I have to get Guise’s secret form again (easy), and then another mint…</p>",
