        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rickjonzz/{size}/1934_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-07-08T16:07:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm a lazy completionist (and, frankly, not good enough at the game to hit the unlock conditions for some) and have been just waiting for the characters to be unlockable, but when I try, Guise says something like \"Think of the Children\" and doesn't unlock. Should I just be more patient and wait or am I going to have to dust off some guides and try to get him the old-fashioned way?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
