        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-12T21:00:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just had something funny happen. I had to get a new phone, and when I reinstalled all my stuff not all of the hero unlocks I had achieved ported over. So, okay, whatever, I just started pushing the \"unlock\" buttons a bunch of times. It was funny to hear Completionist Guise complaining at me over and over as I did!</p>\n<p>Me, too, Guise. Unexpected warranty claims are no fun!</p>",
